    "title": "The Lauren Betts comeback story",
    "text": "Breaking down the inspirational story of UCLA star Lauren Betts and her journey to the final four.Video TranscriptBefore she became one of the nation's top players, Lauren Betts was fighting a battle no one could see.Before she became one of the nation's top players, Lauren Betts was fighting a battle no one could see.Growing up, she was often bullied because of her height, while also carrying the weight of high expectations.Growing up, she was often bullied because of her height, while also carrying the weight of high expectations.She signed with Stanford as the number one recruit in the country, but the pressure quickly became overwhelming.She signed with Stanford as the number one recruit in the country, but the pressure quickly became overwhelming.Even after transferring to UCLA, the struggles didn't just disappear.Even after transferring to UCLA, the struggles didn't just disappear.By 2024, she was battling depression and reached a breaking point, making the courageous decision to check into a psychiatric ward.By 2024, she was battling depression and reached a breaking point, making the courageous decision to check into a psychiatric ward.It was the hardest and ultimately the best decision she ever made.It was the hardest and ultimately the best decision she ever made.Choosing to ask for help and committing to therapy changed everything.Choosing to ask for help and committing to therapy changed everything.Now she's back in the Final Four for the second year in a row, alongside her sister Siena, living out their dreams together.Now she's back in the Final Four for the second year in a row, alongside her sister Siena, living out their dreams together.",
